Panasonic KXL-600A and KXL-601A a.k.a. "Coolshot"
This driver is based upon protocol reverse-engineered
using ComLite32 under Windows 95.
For questions/comments, email the library author:
	Chris Pinkham
	cpinkham@infi.net
