This software is based upon usbsniffing, and therefore is
marked EXPERIMENTAL.
The format of the WAV file is IMA ADPCM (code=0x11) also called DVI ADPCM,
and can be converted with sox -i inputfile outputfile.	
The format of the RAW files is unknown so if anyone finds/knows a way 
to decode it please contact me.
This driver is imported from the pkremote project.
http://sf.net/projects/pkremote/
It uses special SCSI commands tunneled over USB Mass 
Storage to control the camera.
